// Offline and fallback lines for Uncle Ferris Dune (spec/domains/04-npc.md section 5.5). Original development character for the RAP_HYPHY_ELDER slot.

=== greeting ===
Hey, family! Come in, come in, watch the speaker.
-> END

=== smalltalk ===
Swept the street this morning and found a dollar. Best day of the week.
-> END

=== busy ===
Hold on, the speaker is arguing with me. Give me a minute.
-> END

=== deflect ===
That one is above my block. Ask me about the dance floor.
-> END

=== farewell ===
Slide, do not stall. See you Saturday.
-> END
